232
00:14:40,530 --> 00:14:41,680
That reflects well on you, too.

233
00:14:41,960 --> 00:14:42,520
Absolutely.

234
00:14:42,560 --> 00:14:48,520
It reflects positively on your problem solving abilities and your understanding of the organizational structure.

235
00:14:48,590 --> 00:14:58,920
It builds goodwill because the requester sees you as someone who helps them navigate the internal landscape and seeing their need is met rather than just putting up a barrier.

236
00:14:59,080 --> 00:14:59,280
Yeah.

237
00:14:59,360 --> 00:15:02,120
Huge difference between that's not my job and.

