241
00:15:12,280 --> 00:15:18,180
It embodies the spirit of professional collaboration and ensures the request doesn't just get lost in the shuffle.

242
00:15:18,520 --> 00:15:19,300
Makes sense.

243
00:15:19,600 --> 00:15:24,850
Now let's move to a higher level of no one that originates from a strategic perspective.

244
