346
00:22:01,840 --> 00:22:02,840
We've probably all heard that one.

347
00:22:03,140 --> 00:22:03,800
Uh-huh, probably.

348
00:22:04,120 --> 00:22:10,450
You might also state, due to new GDPR regulatory requirements, we cannot proceed with this data request.

349
