00:26:17,050 --> 00:26:17,530
Exactly.

410
00:26:17,630 --> 00:26:25,420
The phrases for this include things like I lack the sales data for this Q3 forecast or we don't have enough user information to proceed with the design.

411
00:26:25,850 --> 00:26:28,210
Pointing to specific missing pieces.

412
00:26:28,220 --> 00:26:28,460
Yeah.

